<title>USA: AFTER THE BELL - Lucent eases from close.</title>
<headline>AFTER THE BELL - Lucent eases from close.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lucent Technologies Inc eased 1/4 to 45-5/8 in after-hours trade, after having closed 2-1/4 higher on the NYSE, following completion of its spin-off from AT&amp;T Corp.</p>
<p>Overall after-hours trade was light, traders said.</p>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said United American Healthcare Corp, Kellwood Co and American Eagle Group Inc were unavailable for after-hours trade for news.</p>
<p>The NYSE said session one volume was 308,300 shares, compared to 3,068,700 Friday. Session two volume was 5,641,739 shares versus no shares Friday.</p>
<p>The American Stock Exchange said there was no after-hours activity.</p>
</text>
